摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local-first visual media plugin for DeepSeek Harness: local video preprocessing, native vision, copyable image history, and video playback.","id":"gh:1333759458","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-visual-plugin","slug":"jyh20030112/dsh-visual-plugin","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","image-description","llm","multimodal","openai-compatible","typescript","vision"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local-first visual media plugin for DeepSeek Harness: local video preprocessing, native vision, copy"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"able image history, and video playback."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-visual-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A local-first visual media plugin for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Validate, transcode, and extract video keyframes locally; understand images and\nvideos with DSH's cu"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rrent vision model, view image history, and play videos in the right panel."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A plugin for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Video preprocessing and plugin-owned media storage stay on the machine running DSH. Images and extra"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"cted keyframes are sent through DSH to your selected model; whether inference runs locally depends o"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"n your DSH model configuration."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Native image understanding** — uploaded images stay on DSH's native attachment and model path; t"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"he plugin does not configure or call a separate vision model.\n- **Copyable image history** — the rig"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ht panel records the current DSH model's final answer beside each image thumbnail, with expandable h"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"istory and one-click copy.\n- **Plugin-owned video upload** — accepts MP4, M4V, MOV, AVI, MPG/MPEG, M"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"KV, and WebM only when extension, signature, and FFprobe agree.\n- **Scene-aware video analysis** — n"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ormalizes to H.264/yuv420p MP4, extracts keyframes with PySceneDetect, and sends ordered timestamped"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" images to the current DSH vision model.\n- **Right-side panel** — switch between image/video views, "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"play normalized videos directly, and stage a selected video in the chat draft.\n- **Advanced video se"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ttings** — tune upload size, storage quota, duration, output size, FPS, CRF, and keyframe count from"},{"id":"p9s10","text":" the plugin settings card."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The plugin never rewrites model messages or calls a private vision endpoint. Select an image-capable"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" model in DSH before sending images or asking about a video."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Plugin `0.4.x` targets DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`; keep plugin `0.3.2` for DSH `0.1.x`. No exact-version risk "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"exemption is needed."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. Install host dependencies"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Image features work without these tools. Video support requires FFmpeg/FFprobe `>= 6.1` from the sam"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e major release, an FFmpeg build with `libx264`, and PySceneDetect `>= 0.7.1 < 0.8`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install the tools on the machine and under the user account that runs `dsh web`. The commands `ffmpe"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"g`, `ffprobe`, and `scenedetect` must be available on that process's `PATH`, from any directory. If "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"DSH runs in Docker, WSL, or on a remote server, install the dependencies inside that environment."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"#### macOS (Homebrew)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install Homebrew first if needed, and follow its post-install instructions to add `brew` to your `PA"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"TH`. Then install FFmpeg, which includes FFprobe, and uv:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"#### Arch Linux (pacman)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Install the official FFmpeg and uv packages:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"#### Windows (PowerShell, WinGet)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Open PowerShell and confirm WinGet is available with `winget --version`. If it is missing, install o"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"r update **App Installer** using the instructions in that link. On Windows x64, install FFmpeg (incl"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"uding FFprobe) and uv:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Close and reopen PowerShell before continuing so the new `PATH` takes effect. If WinGet is unavailab"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"le, use a Windows build linked from the FFmpeg download page, extract it to a permanent directory su"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ch as `C:\\Tools\\ffmpeg`, and add the directory containing `ffmpeg.exe` and `ffprobe.exe` (usually `b"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"in`) to your user `Path` in **Environment Variables**. Install uv using its official Windows instruc"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"o your user `Path` in **Environment Variables**. Install uv using its official Windows instructions."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"#### Install PySceneDetect with uv (all three systems)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Run the following in your terminal or PowerShell:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"This installs PySceneDetect as a persistent command in an isolated environment for the current user."},{"id":"p31s2","text":" uv downloads Python 3.12 if needed; the standard `scenedetect` package includes its OpenCV dependen"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"cies. You do not need to activate a virtual environment before starting DSH. See the uv tool guide a"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"nd PySceneDetect installation guide."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 2. Verify dependencies"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Close and reopen your terminal after `uv tool update-shell`. In the same environment you will use to"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" your terminal after `uv tool update-shell`. In the same environment you will use to start DSH, run:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Confirm FFmpeg and FFprobe are both `>= 6.1` and have the same major version, the encoder list inclu"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"des `libx264`, and PySceneDetect is `>= 0.7.1 < 0.8`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"If a command is missing, locate it with `command -v ffmpeg ffprobe scenedetect` on macOS/Arch, or `G"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"et-Command ffmpeg, ffprobe, scenedetect` in PowerShell. For PySceneDetect, `uv tool dir --bin` shows"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" the directory that must be on `PATH`. Services and containers must also receive this `PATH`; restar"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"t the DSH process after changing it."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The plugin never downloads these tools or runs installers. The settings card reports video dependenc"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"y issues while image features remain available."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### 3. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"When developing this checkout against a local DeepSeek Harness source tree, install the local packag"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"oping this checkout against a local DeepSeek Harness source tree, install the local package instead:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"`bootstrap` requires an installed, built `dsh-v0.2.0-rc.2` Harness checkout and automatically finds "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"a sibling or ancestor-adjacent checkout.\nFor another layout, set its location explicitly:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### 4. Restart and use"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` from the environment where the dependency checks passed, then:"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → Plugins**, then the **dsh-visual-plugin** detail page and its **Visual Media** "},{"id":"p46s2","text":"configuration. Use **Sidebar** to show or hide the right panel and adjust advanced video settings. C"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"hanges apply immediately, persist in the current profile across restarts, and recover valid archived"},{"id":"p46s4","text":" video preferences without overwriting new settings during upgrades."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"2. Select an image-capable model in DSH; there is no separate vision-model configuration in this plu"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"gin.\n3. Send an image. The current model answers natively, and the image panel records the thumbnail"},{"id":"p47s3","text":" and final answer for copying.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
